<schedule>
<gnauralfile_version>1.20101006</gnauralfile_version>
<gnaural_version>1.0.20110606</gnaural_version>
<title>Brain Machine Meditation</title>
<schedule_description>The sequence starts with lots of Beta (awake / conscious), which is where most people will be when they begin. Then Alpha waves (dreamy / trancy) are added, to connect with subconscious Theta that will be coming up. Then the Beta is reduced (for less conscious, making it easier to be move more into a trance). Then some Theta (more subconscious) is added, and in the middle, there are some pulses of Delta (creativity). Then the sequence is reversed, to come back up, nice and refreshed.</schedule_description>
<author>Mitch Altman</author>
